 116:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |---------|---------|-----------|---------------------------------------|
 117:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_uart_ex.c ****     |    0    |    0    |    1      |    | SB | 7 bit data | PB | STB |     |
